<title>USA: Incyte files 1.0 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Incyte files 1.0 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Incyte Pharmaceuticals Inc Tuesday said it has registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 1.0 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>All shares are to be sold by the Company.</p>
<p>Underwriters have been granted an option to purchase an additional 150,000 shares to cover over-allotments, if any.</p>
<p>Underwriting is being managed by Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC, Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc and Vector Securities International Inc.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for capital expenditures and expansion of company facilities, among other items.</p>
